The '''End Stone Sword''' can be used as a melee weapon.

When its ability is used, it consumes all of its user's Mana. For every {{Stat|mana|100}} consumed, it gives +1% damage resistance for 5 seconds up to 20%, and a subsequent hit within 5 seconds will have its damage boosted by 25% up to 500% and can only be used in {{Zone|The End}}

The End Stone Sword's damage resistance does not apply to fall damage.

If the ability is activated again while still active, the new damage resistance and damage boost will override the original.

== Trivia ==
* The End Stone Sword's item ability is similar to that of the [[End Stone Bow]]'s, which consumes all {{stat|mana}} and does that much more damage on the next shot.
* The End Stone Sword ability was used to effectively skip the Terracotta phase in [[The Catacombs - Floor VI]]. As the ability no longer works in Dungeons, this no longer works.
*The ability of this sword was used to fight the [[Voidgloom Seraph]], especially in higher tiers. This was due to the fact that when this ability consumes 500 {{Stat|mana}}, it allowed the user to be completely immune to most forms of damage for a short period of time.

